dports (2.2.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Add dports update subcommand with whiptail/dialog TUI for checking and pulling Docker image updates
  * Compare local image config digest against remote manifest to detect available updates
  * Support single-arch and multi-arch manifest lists; graceful fallback to unknown status when registry is unreachable
  * Plain-text numbered menu fallback for environments without whiptail/dialog

